Use:
- Education level.
- Course.
- State.
- Institution.
- Academic year.
- Marks.
- Family income.
- Category.
- Other verified mandatory criteria.

Display three outcomes:

1. Potentially eligible.
2. Not eligible.
3. Insufficient information.

Explain why a scholarship matches.

Show missing information.

Never guarantee eligibility.

Do not display fake AI-generated match scores.

Later, consider machine-learning recommendations only when there is enough reliable data and a measurable benefit.

